<h3><u>Haye Mere Hussain a.s pe kia waqt aagaya</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><span data-ft=""{""tn"":""K""}"" class=""userContent"">Husain (A.s.)..2<br> <br> Maktal Me Jub Husain (A.s.) Pe Khanjar Rawa Hua,<br> <br> Zainab (S.a.) Thi Ek Ret Ke Teele Pe Gam Zada,<br> <span class=""text_exposed_show""><br> Karte The Bain Arz O Sama.. Wa Musibata<br> <br> Markad Me Apne Khaak Udhate Te The Mustafa (S.a.w.w.)<br> <br> Jalti Zameen Pe Bain Yeh Karti Thi Sayyada (S.a.)<br> <br> Ro Ro Ke Ahle Sham Se Kehti Thi Sayyada (S.a.)..2<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.s.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Husain (A.s.), Husain (A.s.)..<br> <br> Ghar Fatema (S.a.) Ka Loot Liya Fauje Sham Ne<br> <br> Luta Hai Kisne Ummat E Khairul Anam Ne<br> <br> Pyasi Nabi Ki Aal Thi Darya Ke Saamne<br> <br> Din Bhar Uthaie Maiyate Shah E Anam Ne<br> <br> Peer O Jawan Kurban Kiye Tashnakaam Ne<br> <br> Aaya Na Koi Bhi Mere Bacche Ko Tham Ne<br> <br> Sabro Raza Ke Sare Imtehan De Gay<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.s.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Ek Sar Ajal Ne Maanga Bahattar Fida Kiye<br> <br> Ashab E Ba Wafa Tahe Khanjar Fida Kiye<br> <br> Pale Hue Sub God Ke Has Kar Fida Kiye<br> <br> Zainab (S.a.) Ke Do Haseen Gul E Tar Fida Kiye<br> <br> Jaun O Habib O Hur Se Baradar Fida Kiye<br> <br> Deen E Khuda Pe Akbar (A.s.) O Asgar (A.s.) Fida Diye<br> <br> Dard E Judaie Qasim (A.s) O Abbas (A.s.) Ka Mila<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.s.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Kya Haq Rasool E Pak (S.a.w.w.) Ka Tumne Ada Kiya<br> <br> Har Zulm Ko Husain (A.s.) Pe Tumne Rawa Kiya<br> <br> Lekin Mere Husain (A.s.) Ne Dekho To Kya Kiya<br> <br> Jo Wada Bachpane Me Kiya Tha Wafa Kiya<br> <br> Karbobala Ki Khak Ko Khaak E Shifa Kiya<br> <br> Jalti Zameen Pe Shukra Ka Sajda Ada Kiya<br> <br> Mazloomi Yat Ki Sari Hadein Par Kar Gaya<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.s.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Banjar Zameen Ki Shan Badhaie Husain (A.a.) Ne<br> <br> Teeron Ki Janamaz Bichaie Husain (A.s.) Ne<br> <br> Aaisi Namaz Ban Me Padhaie Husain (A.s.) Ne<br> <br> Teg O Tabar Ki Pyas Bujhaie Husain (A.s.) Ne<br> <br> Tawheed Apne Khoon Se Bachaie Husain (A.s.) Ne<br> <br> Falaq Ki Kabr Ban Me Banaie Husain (A.s.) Ne<br> <br> Noke Sina Pe Bolta Quran Ho Gaya<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.S.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Tha Teen Shab O Roz Ka Pyasa Mera Husain (A.s.)<br> <br> Narga Tha Sitamgaron Ka Tanha Mera Husain (A.s.)<br> <br> Tanha Har Ek Shaheed Ko Roya Mera Husain (A.s.)<br> <br> Zakhmon Se Jub Ke Choor Hua Tha Mera Husain (A.s.)<br> <br> Ghode Se Kya Zameen Pe Aaya Mera Husain (A.s.)<br> <br> Na Zeen Na Zameen Pe Thaira Mera Husain (A.s.)<br> <br> Buz Sajda E Tazeem Me Sar Ko Jhuka Diya<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.S.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Asgar (A.s.)Ki Kabr Khod Ke Roti Thi Zulfeqar<br> <br> Kitna Neyam Me Sabr Mein Tadpi Thi Zulfeqar<br> <br> Zainab (S.a.) Ki Tarha Sog Me Rehti Thi Zulfeqar<br> <br> Woh Ke Adu Ke Khoon Ki Pyasi Thi Zulfeqar<br> <br> Hanga Me Asr Nyam Se Nikli Thi Zulfeqar<br> <br> Yeh Fauj E Be Murad Se Kehti Thi Zulfeqar<br> <br> Tum Iski Jung Dekho Jo Barbad Ho Gaya<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.S.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Jub Tak Sipa He Sham Se Yeh Keh Ke Purmalal<br> <br> Tum Uski Jung Dekho Jo Sadmon Se Hai Nidhal<br> <br> Mai Fauj E Na Murad Se Karta Hun Ek Sawal<br> <br> Mujrim Tumhara Mai Tha Ya Bano (S.a.) Ka Nawnihal<br> <br> Akbar (A.s.) Se Naujawn Ka Tumne Kiya Qital<br> <br> Qasim (A.s) Ki Lash Ghodon Se Ki Tum Ne Paymal<br> <br> Ab Uski Jung Dekho Jo Lashe Utha Chukka<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.S.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Tum Kya Samajh Rahe The Ke Ghar Ko Ujad Kar<br> <br> Qasim (A.s) Se Nawjan Pe Ghode Guzar Kar<br> <br> Akbar (A..) Ke Dil Me Zulm Ki Barchi Utar Kar<br> <br> Bayat Milengi Teer Se Asgar (A.s.) Ko Maar Kar<br> <br> Mai Mutmain Hun Deen Pe In Sub Ko Maar Kar<br> <br> Noke Sina Pe Sar Mera Rakhonge Haar Kar<br> <br> Goonjengi Qaiyanat Me Har Simt Ek Sada<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.S.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Farhan Nawhakhwan Hai Ya Mazhar Abedi<br> <br> Dete Hai Is Jahan Ko Paigam Bus Yehi<br> <br> Yeh Jo Gali Gali Mein Hai Lashe Biche Hue<br> <br> Har Waqt Ke Yazeed (La) Ki Koshish Hai Aaj Bhi<br> <br> Mit Jaaie Is Jahan Se Majlis Husain (A.s.) Ki<br> <br> Wada Magar Husain (A.s.) Ki Madar Se Hai Yehi<br> <br> Jaan De Kar Karte Jaienge Matam Husain (A.s) Ka<br> <br> Haye Mere Husain (A.s.) Pe Kya Wakt Aagaya..2<br> <br> Ya Janabe Sayyada (S.a.) .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Ya Ali (A.s.) E Murtaza .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Saiyad E Abrar (A.S.) Ke .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Shah (A.S) Ke Ansar Ke .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Sheh (A.s.) Ke Alamdar (A.s.)Ke .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Akbar (A.S) Ke Zeejah Ke .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Qasim (A.S.) E Nashah Ke .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Aun (A.S.) O Mohammad (A.S.) Ke Bhi Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Bali Sakina (S.A) Ke Bhi .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Asgar (A.S.) E Masoom Ke .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Shahzadi E Qulsoom (S.A.) Ke .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Zainab (S.A.) E Nawshad Ke .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Han Sayyad E Sajjad (A.S) Ke .. Aaie Hai Purse Ko Hum<br> <br> Ya Janabe Sayyada (S.a)..4</span></span></p>
